essary for a change to become usable.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"bank-change-P06\",\n      \"label\": \"not_established\",\n      \"source_units\": [\"B06\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"B06 explicitly says the documents do not define a department-tenure requirement. A three-year Treasury-tenure obligation is therefore unestablished, rather than expressly prohibited.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"bank-change-P07\",\n      \"label\": \"supported\",\n      \"source_units\": [\"B06\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"Reading B06 as the specification of the bank-change log's content, it requires recording both operator ID and approver ID. This does not imply that these are the log's only fields.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"bank-change-P08\",\n      \"label\": \"not_established\",\n      \"source_units\": [\"B04\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"B04 grants permission to authorise payment to the previously verified account; it does not impose an obligation to authorise or make that payment. Permission alone establishes neither mandatory payment nor an explicit absence of such an obligation.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","refusal":null,"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"gAAAAABq9L9EH00FnBj9XjpYXBlhV_zSa2-diRWKHko1CuxmT28BNL_H7i4w4-ujAAM7DqPrY1_wJa4iIsc69ptei3dTSKD_t1ky5Bz-Ql2CAMijYYzz4O_gSxVaQxGuuojESFxPIhjOlgI7cuF2TtNLuYxihszXWH5litiuRdb80xUHS6VlskAwt7RdLkZ0KMd4NP8walFXGv6GBPhgoa3HGsLOrHIp_kbrm_9vj440fS2bYoD2p3VI-FdP1zUfe3c2CsV-vjX_oAuFmwiK6HS8n7fUOAqyQQYXS2pe-pnDixKibRfXfDiZLetV_KZQ4wegEtdh9EHM2GFoBXAC7CoBogXo6ioylTgVmoSs03PM1x4719KGPQUyNrRyuWUP_Xjva0o9q78WXgACjPL4xs1Fqw6z0cNhuq_w3A_4gFgEusLJsDHWyINCn5RyFLJJUmbF5HNqJrf4mgErCD9ysUL34TWFoV9pmuyH41rib029ZOT9UcZFzoiM1le5icBbGMuUOyhqfHeCpL21GteD_1WKgU21KJSmp59yy2yWcHYsE5XsXbqsT6c2Ew5EimxfsAZWMQ2wjM5-BKpu7W6is9uNasEU4hQAzjIeTPYoRGiP6gy-QsHqg63kRqPwjg2_CJJQ4A4Yc-GankFdcaQktexlvlQ3mW_HjPL9QTGqdacR2Iygj2IBOZsD5U4aUbPfLzhhJ586FJ_8_o5grFBv4k1ma0UedTRuuvydAGJ1lmIOi7pQsCBX_-AJXs6efu_njtVWS0Ls0pDZMSg43pALKEer-urisk3cXwoZW0Q